    "id": "gzclp_3day",
    "name": "GZCLP (3-Day)",
    "description": "Linear progression for beginners-to-intermediate. Rotate the four workouts A/B/C/D across your sessions (A,B,C one week; D,A,B the next; etc.). Tier 1 = heavy 5x3+ (last set AMRAP); Tier 2 = 3x10; Tier 3 = 3x15+. When you fail a Tier 1 weight 3 sessions in a row, switch that lift to 6x4+ (then 10x2+, then 10x1+) — see r/fitness GZCLP wiki. Add weight each session: 10 kg lower body / 5 kg upper on Tier 1, then 5/2.5 kg.",
    "goal": "strength",
    "level": "beginner",
    "days_per_week": 3,
    "source": "r/fitness wiki (GZCL method, /u/gzcl)",
